final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_h6dpt")
province = 73
blurb = "Depicts a view from the veranda of Nigatsu-dō (\"second month hall\"), one of the important structures of Tōdai-ji, the main temple complex in Nara, the ancient capital of Japan. Nigatsu-dō was first established in 752, but has been rebuild numerous times since.

It is best known for Omizutori, a fire and water ceremony held annually on the 12th of March. It includes monks holding huge flaming torches from the temple balcony, and on the next day drawing sacred water from a well under the temple. The ceremony has been held without a break for over 1200 years."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
